
README

Copyright (C) 1996 Yosuke Sato

"Set Constraint Solver" is a small system that offers two kinds of programs.
One is for calculating Gr\"{o}bner bases in polynomial rings
over Boolean rings. You can experiment on various calculations  
of our a little bit queer Gr\"{o}bner bases.
The another one is for solving constraints of sets. You can handle
various types of set constraints using our Gr\"{o}bner bases.
The whole program is written in prolog. 
Though we developed the software using SICStus prolog,
it is also available in other prolog compilers with minor changes
of the source program.


